macOS: co-locate record and retired flags in one native TLS object.

Cider-Topic: sync/msync
Cider-Requires: 0104-msync-thread-local-fork-admission.patch
Cider-Status: nondefault candidate; performance and continuous acceptance separate
Cider-Validation: exact mechanical reverse, SDK15.4 native build and PE32/64 runtime

Keep all state transitions, the per-thread destructor key, independent leases,
fork refresh, atomic commit, and recovery unchanged. Only the backing TLS
object changes. The two hot getters each resolve one TLS object instead of two.
This static call count is not a claim of measured speedup.

